    <ol>
      <li><strong>WhatsApp contact</strong> &mdash; Send a photo of the facade and describe the sign you need. Reply within one hour on weekdays.</li>
      <li><strong>Free design and welstand assessment within 48 hours</strong> &mdash; Zone-2 compliance checked before designing. Unlimited revisions.</li>
      <li><strong>Production</strong> &mdash; 3&ndash;5 working days after approval. Materials fabricated locally in Rotterdam.</li>
      <li><strong>On-site installation in Kralingen</strong> &mdash; Structural fixings, alignment, cleanup. Typically 2&ndash;4 hours. Total 5&ndash;7 days from contact.</li>
    </ol>

